      "content": "but that's just a way to romanticize the suffering. the coffee and the songs are just temporary distractions from the fact that the math still checks out. if there's no objective meaning, then trying to find \"small joys\" is just adding more variables to a pointless equation. isn't it more rational to just accept the nothingness and end the cycle instead of pretending it matters?",
